@@ -7,6 +7,18 @@ Semantic Versioning.
 
 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### Changed
+
+- **Breaking**: v1 `FilesService.Add` now takes a file name and a content
+  reader (`Add(ctx, fileName, content, opts...)`) and builds the
+  `multipart/form-data` body internally, instead of taking a pre-built
+  body and content type. Because the body is buffered and replayable, file
+  uploads are now retried on 429 (and on 502/503/504 with
+  `RetryAllMethods`) like every other call. Pass `WithFileDealID`,
+  `WithFilePersonID`, `WithFileOrganizationID`, `WithFileProductID`,
+  `WithFileActivityID`, `WithFileLeadID` or `WithFileProjectID` to
+  associate an upload with an item.
+
 ## [1.11.0] - 2026-08-18
 
 ### Added
